egin="19.399" end="20.754" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="19.399" end="19.822">小伙子</span> <span begin="19.822" end="20.053">你那</span><span begin="20.053" end="20.262">什么</span><span begin="20.262" end="20.392">车</span><span begin="20.392" end="20.754">啊?</span></p><p begin="21.542" end="23.041" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.542" end="22.171">AE86</span><span begin="22.171" end="22.420">啊</span> <span begin="22.594" end="22.716">怎</span><span begin="22.716" end="23.041">样?</span></p><p begin="23.534" end="26.469" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="23.534" end="23.835">A</span><span begin="23.835" end="24.135">E</span><span begin="24.135" end="24.436">8</span><span begin="24.436" end="24.736">6?</span> <span begin="25.590" end="25.849">飘一</span><span begin="25.849" end="25.998">下</span><span begin="25.998" end="26.469">啊</span></p><p begin="27.009" end="27.908" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="27.009" end="27.361">随</span><span begin="27.361" end="27.469">便</span><span begin="27.469" end="27.908">啊</span></p></div><div begin="50.939" end="1:01.635" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="50.939" end="53.552" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.939" end="51.349">找支</span><span begin="51.349" end="51.697">笔</span> <span begin="51.697" end="52.029">写下</span><span begin="52.029" end="52.339">日</span><span begin="52.339" end="52.648">记</span> <span begin="52.648" end="52.949">记录</span><span begin="52.949" end="53.271">勇</span><span begin="53.271" end="53.552">气</span></p><p begin="53.603" end="56.144" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.603" end="53.942">我可</span><span begin="53.942" end="54.253">以</span> <span begin="54.253" end="54.573">对着</span><span begin="54.573" end="54.902">墙</span><span begin="54.902" end="55.222">壁</span> <span begin="55.222" end="55.542">让拳</span><span begin="55.542" end="55.883">头叛</span><span begin="55.883" end="56.144">逆</span></p><p begin="56.161" end="58.997" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="56.161" end="56.482">呼</span><span begin="56.482" end="56.835">吸</span> <span begin="56.835" end="57.175">天窗</span><span begin="57.175" end="57.505">玻</span><span begin="57.505" end="57.828">璃</span> <span begin="57.828" end="58.137">打开</span><span begin="58.137" end="58.363">我的</span><span begin="58.363" end="58.762">身</span><span begin="58.762" end="58.997">体</span></p><p begin="59.025" end="1:01.635" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="59.025" end="59.433">这</span><span begin="59.433" end="59.743">里</span> <span begin="59.743" end="1:00.063">引擎</span><span begin="1:00.063" end="1:01.030">声就像是一种</span><span begin="1:01.030" end="1:01.310">乐</span><span begin="1:01.310" end="1:01.635">器</span></p></div><div begin="1:01.859" end="1:12.317" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:01.859" end="1:04.436" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:01.859" end="1:02.311">所</span><span begin="1:02.311" end="1:02.806">以</span> <span begin="1:02.970" end="1:03.570">风呼啸而</span><span begin="1:03.570" end="1:03.942">过</span><span begin="1:03.942" end="1:04.276">刺</span><span begin="1:04.276" end="1:04.436">激</span></p><p begin="1:04.446" end="1:06.935" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:04.446" end="1:04.896">所</span><span begin="1:04.896" end="1:05.542">以</span> <span begin="1:05.542" end="1:06.176">我在转弯</span><span begin="1:06.176" end="1:06.491">飘</span><span begin="1:06.491" end="1:06.935">移</span></p><p begin="1:06.953" end="1:09.414" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.953" end="1:07.164">加</span><span begin="1:07.164" end="1:07.494">足了</span><span begin="1:07.494" end="1:07.824">马</span><span begin="1:07.824" end="1:08.157">力</span> <span begin="1:08.157" end="1:08.469">飙到</span><span begin="1:08.469" end="1:08.774">底</span> <span begin="1:08.774" end="1:09.100">看仔</span><span begin="1:09.100" end="1:09.414">细</span></p><p begin="1:09.479" end="1:12.317" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.